  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "15553660-a7a2-4a52-af1a-1f679bad8db1",
      "name": "Pipeline Info",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        240,
        -40
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## \ud83d\udcf7 OCR Pipeline \u2013 v2 (3 Input Modes)\n\n**Webhook:** `POST /webhook/learnify-ocr`\n\n**Mode 1 \u2013 Image URL:**\n```json\n{ \"inputType\": \"url\", \"imageUrl\": \"https://...\",\n  \"noteId\": \"...\", \"userId\": \"...\" }\n```\n\n**Mode 2 \u2013 Base64 Upload:**\n```json\n{ \"inputType\": \"upload\", \"imageBase64\": \"<base64>\",\n  \"mimeType\": \"image/jpeg\", \"noteId\": \"...\", \"userId\": \"...\" }\n```\n\n**Mode 3 \u2013 Paste Text (skip OCR):**\n```json\n{ \"inputType\": \"text\", \"extractedText\": \"...\",\n  \"noteId\": \"...\", \"userId\": \"...\" }\n```\n\n**Env vars:** `GOOGLE_PALM_API` credential \u00b7 `backendUrl` in Set Config",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 500,
        "color": 4
      }
    },
